@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

[*] --> ShutDown : [powered-off condition]

state "Shut Down" as ShutDown
state "Running" as Running
state "Configuration Mode" as ConfigMode
state "Controlled Mode" as CtrlMode

Running : entry/system is running
Running : do/collect data when clock triggers
Running : exit/after activity completion

ConfigMode : entry/system in configuration mode
ConfigMode : do/configure system settings
ConfigMode : exit/system returns to running state after completion

CtrlMode : entry/system enters controlled mode
CtrlMode : do/system remains in controlled mode until command changes it

ShutDown --> Running : [Restart Command]
Running --> ConfigMode : [Changes or Power-Saving Settings Required]
ConfigMode --> Running : [Configuration Completed]
Running --> Running : [Clock Trigger (Data Collection)]
Running --> Running : [Request for Weather Summary (Prepare and Send Out Summary)]
Running --> Running : [Request for Status Check (Transmit Result)]
Running, ConfigMode, CtrlMode --> Running : [Activity Completion (Data Collection, Summary Preparation, Status Checking)]
Running --> ShutDown : [Shutdown Command]
Running --> CtrlMode : [Remote Control Command]

state "Final State" as FinalState
FinalState : entry/system reaches final state

Running --> FinalState
ConfigMode --> FinalState
CtrlMode --> FinalState
ShutDown --> FinalState

@enduml
